GPL's own website is only one part of its digital footprint.

Where realistic and authentic, strengthen GPL's visibility through relevant third-party environments such as:

* media and entertainment technology publications
* industry events
* conference participation
* podcasts
* partnerships
* case studies
* directories
* expert commentary
* customer references
* professional communities

The objective is genuine industry presence.

Do not pursue mentions solely to manufacture co-occurrence or simulate authority.

Third-party references are most valuable when they reflect real expertise, participation, partnerships, customers, or industry activity.

